// DEFECT (silent wrong answer). `Count(Foreach person: present(person))` counts every person,
// present or not, so a quorum written this way is always met. Expected: 0, or a warning that the
// body is a constructor and not a test (write `person When present(person)`).
Fact person Identified by Iris, Wren, Abel
Fact present Identified by person.
?Count(Foreach person: present(person)) == 3.              // WRONG: nobody is present
?Count(Foreach person: person When present(person)) == 0.
